{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "the-naked-director-s01e01-scene-15",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "一日百円です  (One Hundred Yen a Day)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "ono": "小野",
    "muranishi": "村西",
    "customer": "客"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Outside Nakai's mansion, Ono bursts out laughing—the last salesman who visited that house ended up in the hospital! Fired up by his breakthrough, Muranishi develops his own passionate style, turning a three-thousand-yen monthly fee into a hundred yen a day. Listen to Muranishi find his voice.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "やるじゃないか！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "知ってたなら教えてくださいよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "愛情だよ。一人前のセールスマンになれる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "英会話の必要性を感じますか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "customer",
      "t": "俺には必要ないね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "わたくしはそのようには考えません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "一日十五分、三か月続けてみてください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "あなた様に人生を諦めてほしくないのです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "customer",
      "t": "でもさ、少し高くない？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "確かに少し高いと感じるかもしれません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "月三千円ということは一日百円です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "高いどころか安すぎると思っております。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Watch how Muranishi agrees politely with a customer's objection before flipping the price upside down.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "やるじゃないか！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, look at you go!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "知ってたなら教えてくださいよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you knew, you should have told me!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "一人前のセールスマンになれる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You can become a full-fledged salesman.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "customer",
      "t": "俺には必要ないね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I do not need it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "一日十五分、三か月続けてみてください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please try keeping at it fifteen minutes a day for three months.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "あなた様に人生を諦めてほしくないのです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I do not want you to give up on your life.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "customer",
      "t": "でもさ、少し高くない？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Still, is it not a little expensive?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "確かに少し高いと感じるかもしれません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Certainly, it might feel a little expensive.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "月三千円ということは一日百円です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Three thousand yen a month means one hundred yen a day.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "高いどころか安すぎると思っております。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Far from being expensive, I believe it is way too cheap.'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "やるじゃないか！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "知ってたなら教えてくださいよ！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "愛情だよ。一人前のセールスマンになれる。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "英会話の必要性を感じますか？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "customer",
      "t": "俺には必要ないね。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "わたくしはそのようには考えません。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "一日十五分、三か月続けてみてください。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "あなた様に人生を諦めてほしくないのです。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "customer",
      "t": "でもさ、少し高くない？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "確かに少し高いと感じるかもしれません。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "月三千円ということは一日百円です。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "高いどころか安すぎると思っております。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Remember the word for expensive, the word for cheap, the expression to invite someone to try something, and the bridging phrase whenever you reframe numbers in your favour. See you in scene sixteen.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "さようなら。",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
